      "text": "\u2022 No boost \u2192 defaultPopularity.enable false\n\u2022 Empty Redis \u2192 wrong expId / bucket / store suffix (defaultBoostKeyGen)\n\u2022 v1 feed score 0 \u2192 HTTP popularity-service failure\n\u2022 trend() data source not verified in workspace",
